<title>UK: Renault sets 2.0 bln FRF nine-year domestic bond.</title>
<headline>Renault sets 2.0 bln FRF nine-year domestic bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following domestic bond was announced by lead manager Banque Nationale de Paris.</p>
<p> BORROWER   RENAULT SA</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN FRF   COUPON     5.80	MATURITY    20.DEC.05</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.81    PAY DATE    20.DEC.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.70	REOFFER    99.46     SPREAD	+40 BP</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 5	   LISTING    PARIS     PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
